Description: BitCurator USB mount-policy indicator and device mounter
 GTK3 applications for the BitCurator environment that manage mounting of
 physical block devices and a system-wide read-only USB mount policy.
 .
 The package provides:
  * bc-mounter, a GUI for mounting and unmounting USB and other block
    devices via udisks2, with live device updates;
  * bc-policyapp, an Ayatana application indicator that toggles the
    read-only USB mount policy;
  * bc-mountpolicy, a privileged helper (invoked via pkexec) that activates
    or deactivates the policy by installing a udev rule which write-protects
    USB devices at the block layer.
 .
 The read-only policy is a convenience to prevent inadvertent writes and is
 not a substitute for a hardware write blocker.
